{"product_id":"3200mah-xtreme-weather-power-bank","title":"3200mAh Xtreme Weather Power Bank","description":"\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe M-Series Xtreme Weather power bank is built to withstand the harshest workplace environments, with operating temperatures ranging from -20℃\/-4℉ to 45℃\/113℉. This lightweight battery has an IP67 rating against dust and water immersion and packs plenty of power for long assignments. Compatible with all M-Series products, it features the easy-to-use rail mounting design that supports Vuzix’ unique hot-swap capabilities, meaning you never need to interrupt your work when changing out the battery.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIncluded in the M400 Xtreme Kit.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Vuzix","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45720908595366,"sku":"536T0A001","price":49.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0581\/1208\/2086\/files\/3200RotationLow-Right.2477_de65d05e-77bb-4a60-aed9-a69b3edea147.png?v=1723152057","url":"https:\/\/www.vuzix.com\/products\/3200mah-xtreme-weather-power-bank","provider":"Vuzix Corporation","version":"1.0","type":"link"}